so:
    Pub/Sub configuration helpers.

A PubSub:
    has:
        dlq_retry_ms: Number = 2000
        dlq_max_len: Number = 1000

    so: Apply pubsub configuration when fields are provided.
    can __configure__() -> Nothing:
        if its.dlq_retry_ms != nil or its.dlq_max_len != nil:
            return pubsub_configure(its)
        return nothing
